rtemis.draw as a whole is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause License (see
LICENSE for the copyright holder and year).

The package bundles the third-party JavaScript libraries and map data listed
below, so that charts render offline and in self-contained HTML. Each
component remains under its own license. The complete upstream license and
notice texts are retained verbatim in inst/third-party/<package>@<version>.txt
(installed as third-party/), and inst/third-party/README.md explains how each
file was obtained or built. Build sources and npm lockfiles for the generated
bundles are in tools/graph-bundle, tools/map-bundle and tools/geo-bundle.


Bundled files
-------------

inst/htmlwidgets/lib/echarts/echarts.min.js
    ECharts 6.1.0, which includes ZRender 6.1.0. Unmodified upstream
    distribution file (dist/echarts.min.js from the echarts npm package).

inst/htmlwidgets/lib/echarts-gl/echarts-gl.min.js
    ECharts-GL 2.1.0, which includes ClayGL 1.3.0. Unmodified upstream
    distribution file; its LICENSE and .LICENSE.txt companions are retained
    alongside it.

inst/htmlwidgets/lib/sigma/rtemis-graph-deps.js
inst/node/graph-deps.js
    Bundles of sigma, graphology and their dependencies, built with esbuild
    from tools/graph-bundle. inst/node/graph-deps.LICENSE.txt lists the
    components in the Node bundle.

inst/htmlwidgets/lib/maplibre/rtemis-map-deps.js
inst/node/map-deps.js
    Bundles of MapLibre GL JS, d3-geo, d3-scale-chromatic and topojson-client
    with their dependencies, built with esbuild from tools/map-bundle.
    inst/node/map-deps.LICENSE.txt lists the components in the Node bundle.

inst/htmlwidgets/lib/geo/us-10m.topo.json
    counties-10m.json from us-atlas 3.0.1 (ISC, Copyright 2013-2019 Michael
    Bostock), unmodified; notice in inst/htmlwidgets/lib/geo/us-atlas-LICENSE.txt.
    Derived from the U.S. Census Bureau 2017 cartographic boundary files.

inst/htmlwidgets/lib/geo/countries.topo.json
    Built from Natural Earth 5.1.2 1:110m admin-0 countries, which Natural
    Earth places in the public domain. Provenance and hashes in
    inst/htmlwidgets/lib/geo/countries.source.json.

All other files under inst/htmlwidgets and inst/node are part of rtemis.draw.


